{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/extras/Fate_EN.png?t=1745318450\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/extras/Dragon4.gif?t=1745318450\" />The dragon snatched the princess, and the tsar commands you to undertake a mission from which none have returned. Ahead lie forests, swamps, and fairy-tale creatures that may either aid or deceive you. Fight for the princess, flee, or uncover the dragon\u2019s hidden secret? The choice is yours\u2014but brace yourself for the unexpected!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/extras/\u0421hoose_EN.png?t=1745318450\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/extras/About_EN.gif?t=1745318450\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every situation is a scene with two cards. Help push the cart or deceive the guards? Choose, test the outcome, and don\u2019t be surprised if you end up in the bushes instead of performing a heroic deed. Paths branch, endings vary, and death is just a reason to start anew. Prove you can handle this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3254800?t=1745318450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/809c43f0fc8ea6c9769ed9305bda5bc109d0f1ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745318450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/858e073ec9ffe46461c81bb1b9c7716574d9f6c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745318450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/858e073ec9ffe46461c81bb1b9c7716574d9f6c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745318450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3546880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/extras/Fate_EN.png?t=1745318450\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/extras/Dragon4.gif?t=1745318450\" />The dragon snatched the princess, and the tsar commands you to undertake a mission from which none have returned. Ahead lie forests, swamps, and fairy-tale creatures that may either aid or deceive you. Fight for the princess, flee, or uncover the dragon\u2019s hidden secret? The choice is yours\u2014but brace yourself for the unexpected!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/extras/\u0421hoose_EN.png?t=1745318450\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/extras/About_EN.gif?t=1745318450\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every situation is a scene with two cards. Help push the cart or deceive the guards? Choose, test the outcome, and don\u2019t be surprised if you end up in the bushes instead of performing a heroic deed. Paths branch, endings vary, and death is just a reason to start anew. Prove you can handle this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["HGISoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3254800/52e96de14605b6c1efb18e7701045b53fc6eedee/header.jpg?t=1745318450","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"min